<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Guess the Score - Privacy Policy</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="nav-brand">Guess the Score</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container">
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>Last updated: 2026</p>

    <h3>Data we collect</h3>
    <p>We collect the minimum needed to run the game: your username, a securely hashed password (never stored in plain text), your leagues, and your score predictions.</p>

    <h3>Cookies</h3>
    <p>We use a session cookie to keep you signed in. When advertising is enabled, Google AdSense may set cookies to serve and personalize ads. You can accept or decline advertising cookies using the consent banner shown on first visit; declining disables ads and advertising cookies.</p>

    <h3>Third parties</h3>
    <p>If advertising is enabled, Google AdSense may process data in accordance with <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener">Google's advertising policies</a>. We do not sell your personal data.</p>

    <h3>Your choices</h3>
    <p>You can delete your account data by leaving and having a league owner delete your league, or by contacting us. Advertising consent can be changed by clearing your browser cookies for this site.</p>

    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent through the details on the <a href="/about">About</a> page.</p>
  </div>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/consent-banner') %>
</body>
</html>
